*** Keywords ***
Verify {{MODULE_TITLE}} Case
    [Documentation]    Template chạy 1 row CSV: build payload, gọi API, assert response.
    [Arguments]    ${Descriptions}    ${field_name}    ${test_value}    ${expected_code}    ${expected_message}    ${Tag}
    Apply CSV Tags    ${Tag}
    ${payload}=    Build {{MODULE_TITLE}} Payload For Test    ${field_name}    ${test_value}
    Log Dictionary    ${payload}
    ${response}=    Call {{MODULE_TITLE}} API With Payload    ${payload}
    Log    HTTP ${response.status_code} | body=${response.text}
    Assert {{MODULE_TITLE}} Response    ${response}    ${expected_code}    ${expected_message}
